    <div class="card hl"><p><strong>Sommersalon „Neonzauber"</strong> <span class="est">Klubhaus St. Pauli · 19:00–01:00</span></p><p>All-you-can-drink, 80er/90er/2000er. <span class="price">61,70 €</span>.</p></div>
